{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INFERIAE</strong> is a Visual Concept Album by the experimental one-piece<strong> ACCURST</strong>. Unlike Visual Novels, where the focus is on the story, here the emphasis is on the music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This Visual Concept Album unfolds over 2 hours of new material of experimental, horror ambient music, with around 250 haunting backgrounds and roughly 10,000 words accompanying you deeper into darkness &amp; despondency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>This demo includes the first 20 minutes of the Visual Concept Album over 3 music tracks.</u></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4050720/extras/a4a29ec3b72f6c832c6a30e510217074.avif?t=1759028984\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ACCURST</strong>\u00a0has been a sound artist since the early 2000s, having been featured in the Blumhouse films <i>Sinister</i> (2012) and <i>Sinister 2</i> (2015), among other projects and collaborations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What started in 2003 as a trilogy of concept albums, has reached its final phase with<strong>\u00a0</strong>a new, original experience, dubbed as a Visual Concept Album. This project is the culmination of over 20 years of work in the field of esoteric auditory paintings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is<strong> ACCURST</strong>'s epilogue album <strong>\u2014</strong> a final statement completing the circle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Headphones recommended.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4050720?t=1759028984","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4050720?t=1759028984","capsu